flowchart TD
  A[Developer pushes to feature branch] --> B[Open PR to dev]
  B --> C[GitHub checks]
  C -->|pass| D[Merge to dev]
  C -->|fail| E[fix on feature branch]
  D --> F[Render auto-deploy from dev]
  D --> G[preview-dev-delivery workflow]
  G --> H[Mobile preview automation + config gates]
  G --> I[Staging SHA check and API environment check]
  H --> J[Classifier]
  J -->|ota-compatible| K[Android OTA + duplicate guard]
  J -->|native-required| L[Manual Native path]
  J -->|unrelated| M[no Publish]
  I --> N[iOS preview build gate]
  K --> O[Android preview publish]
  L --> P[Owner decides whether to publish native]
  N --> Q[iOS TestFlight submission path]
  O --> R[Installed tester + evidence]
  Q --> R
